{"name":"Cabincore","title":"Cabincore","revision":220069,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Cabincore","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Cabincore is an aesthetic that romanticizes the life of residing in a cabin. Similar to Cottagecore, Naturecore, Earthcore, Campcore, and Adventurecore, Cabincore embraces the idea of getting away from bustling industrial life, favoring places where days can be spent in a more remote setting. The aesthetic features a rustic, relaxing, warm cabin theme."},{"kind":"heading","text":"History"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Cabincore has been highlighted by various lifestyle publications. Apartment Therapy described the style as \"dimming the lights on the airy, breezy feel of summer,\" while Refinery 29 characterized it as an aesthetic that starts with \"carabiners, fire, farmhouse tables, [and] 50 shades of flannel.\""},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Since Cabincore is associated heavily with being calm and relaxed, cozy clothes are a staple."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Tops"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cozy Sweaters"},{"kind":"list","text":"Flannels"},{"kind":"list","text":"Warm, thick coats."},{"kind":"list","text":"Vests"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jackets (denim, corduroy, down, etc.)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Bottoms"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jeans"},{"kind":"list","text":"Overalls"},{"kind":"list","text":"Corduroy Trousers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Wool Skirts"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Footwear"},{"kind":"list","text":"Warm socks - Smartwools and fuzzy socks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Slippers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hiking/work boots, timberlands, docs, suede boots and rainboots"},{"kind":"list","text":"Birkenstocks, Crocs"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Accessories"},{"kind":"list","text":"Watches"},{"kind":"list","text":"Thick Belts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Small, plain jewelry"},{"kind":"list","text":"Carabiners, multitools"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lanyards, keychains"},{"kind":"list","text":"Beanies, brimmed hats, baseball caps"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gloves"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fabrics/Textiles"},{"kind":"list","text":"Wool"},{"kind":"list","text":"Corduroy"},{"kind":"list","text":"Leather"},{"kind":"list","text":"Denim"},{"kind":"list","text":"Flannel"},{"kind":"list","text":"Chunky Knits"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Hairstyles"},{"kind":"list","text":"Braided Styles"},{"kind":"list","text":"Messy buns"},{"kind":"list","text":"Curly"},{"kind":"list","text":"Ponytails"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pretty much anything, especially if functional"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Stylistic"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Activities"},{"kind":"list","text":"Apple Picking"},{"kind":"list","text":"Baking and Cooking"},{"kind":"list","text":"Basket making"},{"kind":"list","text":"Building a treehouse"},{"kind":"list","text":"Camping"},{"kind":"list","text":"Embroidery while listening to your favorite music"},{"kind":"list","text":"Foraging"},{"kind":"list","text":"Getting lost in the woods"},{"kind":"list","text":"Growing an herb garden"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hiking and Nature Walks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Journaling"},{"kind":"list","text":"Knitting, crocheting, felting, weaving"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lighting cozy candles and watching the rain"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mushroom Foraging"},{"kind":"list","text":"Morning hot drinks on a foggy day."},{"kind":"list","text":"Playing music"},{"kind":"list","text":"Reading"},{"kind":"list","text":"Roasting S'mores"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sitting and watching the world live"},{"kind":"list","text":"Stargazing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Starting a campfire"},{"kind":"list","text":"Snowshoeing, Skiing, Snowboarding"},{"kind":"list","text":"Spontaneous walks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Telling stories around the campfire"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tree Climbing"},{"kind":"list","text":"Watching the sunrise and the sunset"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"TV Shows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Peter and the Wolf (2006)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gravity Falls (2012-2016)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Treehouse Masters (2013-2019)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Over the Garden Wall (2014)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Chilling Adventures of Sabrina (2018-2020)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Ren & Stimpy Show (1991-1996)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sweet Tooth (2021)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bunk'd (2015)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Books"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lord of the Rings (1954) by J.R.R. Tolkien"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Chronicles of Narnia (1956) by C.S. Lewis"},{"kind":"list","text":"Men For the Mountains (1978) by Sid Marty"},{"kind":"list","text":"Harry Potter (1997-2007) by J.K. Rowling"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Treehouse Book (2000) by Pete and Judy Nelson"},{"kind":"list","text":"Wild: From Lost to Found on the Pacific Crest Trail (2012) by Cheryl Strayed"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cabin Porn (2015) by Zach Klein"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cabin Porn: Inside (2019) by Zach Klein"},{"kind":"list","text":"Don't Call the Wolf (2020) by Aleksandra Ross"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Movies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Stand by Me (1986)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Lord of the Rings (2001-2003)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Harry Potter (2001-2011)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Dreamcatcher (2003)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Chronicles of Narnia (2005)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Moonrise Kingdom (2012)"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Kings of Summer (2013)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bears (2014)"},{"kind":"list","text":"A Walk in the Woods (2015)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Paddington (2016)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Tuck Everlasting (2002)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Video Games"},{"kind":"list","text":"Stardew Valley (2016)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Life is Strange 2 (2018)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Life is Strange: True Colors (2021)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Red Dead Redemption 2 (2018)"}